sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Browser
    participant Google as Google
    participant API as API function
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Mail as Mail server

    User->>API: POST /v1/auth/register
    API->>API: Length, blocklist, own details,<br/>breach lookup
    API->>DB: Unverified user,<br/>token hash valid 24 h
    API->>Mail: Link with the raw token,<br/>at most 3 per hour and address
    API-->>User: 201, session token
    Note over User,API: Watch, like and comment,<br/>but no upload until verified

    alt Follows the link
        User->>API: POST /v1/auth/verify-email<br/>(token in the body)
        API->>DB: Spend the token if unused<br/>and not expired, mark verified
        API-->>User: 200, verified
    else Google sign-in with the same address
        User->>Google: Sign in
        Google-->>User: ID token
        User->>API: POST /v1/auth/google
        API->>Google: Verify the ID token
        alt Local account not verified
            API->>DB: Take it over: verified,<br/>no password, sessions revoked
            API-->>User: 200, session token
        else Local account already verified
            API-->>User: 409 ACCOUNT_EXISTS,<br/>link Google in the settings
        end
    end
